---
<section id="contact" class="bg-dark py-16 font-sans">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-12 text-light relative">
            Contato
            <span class="absolute bottom-0 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 w-24 h-1 bg-primary mt-2"></span>
        </h2>
        <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
            <div class="bg-light bg-opacity-5 p-8 rounded-lg shadow-lg">
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-6 text-secondary">Vamos conversar?</h3>
                <p class="text-light mb-6">Estou sempre aberto a discutir novos projetos, oportunidades criativas ou parcerias.</p>
                <ul class="space-y-4">
                    <li class="flex items-center">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6 mr-3 text-primary flex-shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z" />
                        </svg>
                        <div class="flex flex-col">
                            <span class="text-light">vrs@brameri.com</span>
                            <span class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Email profissional</span>
                        </div>
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex items-center">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6 mr-3 text-primary flex-shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z" />
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" />
                        </svg>
                        <div class="flex flex-col">
                            <span class="text-light">Naviraí, MS - Brasil</span>
                            <span class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Disponível para trabalho remoto</span>
                        </div>
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex items-center">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6 mr-3 text-primary flex-shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 12a9 9 0 01-9 9m9-9a9 9 0 00-9-9m9 9H3m9 9a9 9 0 01-9-9m9 9c1.657 0 3-4.03 3-9s-1.343-9-3-9m0 18c-1.657 0-3-4.03-3-9s1.343-9 3-9m-9 9a9 9 0 019-9" />
                        </svg>
                        <div class="flex flex-col">
                            <a href="https://github.com/Vitor-rs" target="_blank" class="text-light hover:text-primary transition-colors">github.com/Vitor-rs</a>
                            <span class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Confira meus projetos</span>
                        </div>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

